        "heading_RpVdUm": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Tribute To the Greenskeepers",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_FPkaHR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p> K-Swiss teams up with Phoenix-based lifestyle brand Manor for a collection rooted in legacy, community, and craft. Honoring golf’s unsung greenskeepers —the quiet stewards who turn courses into playable art — the drop reimagines two icons: the Classic VN with off-white soles flecked in green, and the Si-18 International in a bold green colorway. Together, they carry forward a story where craft meets community and sport shapes culture.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
