            "subtitle_font_size": "fs-sm",
            "title": "ART OF THE GAME",
            "title_font_size": "h1",
            "description": "<p>In honor of Black History Month, we partnered with Counterpoint to support their Art of the Game initiative. With help from Rakeem Miles, the Utah Jazz, and Spyhop, students were able to learn the process of shoe design using donated K-Swiss shoes, supplies, and expertise. We value events like these that give space to young creators to meet their peers, grow their network, and discover their paths to a creative future.</p>",
