            "title_font_size": "h1",
            "description": "<p>We teamed up with Top Dawg Entertainment for their annual holiday concert and toy drive in Watts, California—donating 500 pairs of shoes to local individuals. With TDE’s prominent artists like Doechii, Kendrick Lamar, and SZA, we united through music and generosity to uplift a community that continues to shape the artists of tomorrow.</p>",
