            "title": "SHARING THE ARTS",
            "title_font_size": "h1",
            "description": "<p>In partnering with Sub Zero, a transformative mental health event, we’re championing authenticity and giving back to the city that shaped K-Swiss. By donating shoes and resources, we’re empowering local youth to find their voice through fashion and music. Together, we’re creating a powerful space where every story resonates.</p>",
